    note: "TLAPS proves Spec => []Agreement for both: Inv holds at the start, every step keeps it and it implies Agreement (DecreeProof.tla, MultiPaxosProof.tla), and LS4 checks the temporal rule that joins them. The Lean proofs are a later step of #1307.",
